<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115252" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάγδᾱν</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱνος</span>, or
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάγδας</span></b> , ὁ, an Egyptian <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unguent</i>; the following forms are found: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰγυπτίῳ ψάγδανι τρὶς λελουμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					102
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρ᾽ ἴδω, τί σοι δῶ τῶν μύρων;
					ψάγδαν φιλεῖς;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					206
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάγδαν ἐρυγγάνοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					198
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάκκαρίς τε καὶ σάγδας ὁμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epil.
					1
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάδᾳ</span> (sic codd.) is cited
			by <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i> fr. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> (not found in codd. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>), and fr. <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				198
			</span></i>?): nom. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψαγδης</span> (unaccented)
				<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.690e
			</span></i>, cf. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψαγδῆς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Egypt. <i>sgnn</i> with or without prefixed masc. Art.
				<i>p;</i>).</div>
